# LaTeX build intermediates (regenerated by latexmk; keep source only).
# The compiled PDF is intentionally ignored here (unlike paper/icml2026.pdf):
# this source ships in the double-blind anonymized supplement, and a binary PDF
# can carry author identity in its metadata that the export's text-only
# self-check cannot see. The paper PDF is submitted separately via OpenReview.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.pdf
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
